# Veripsa release gate (auto-discovered). One gate per file -> two PRs adding gates add two FILES, never a
# shared line -> no false merge conflict on registration. register_gate is defined in run_gates.sh.
# Format: register_gate <test> <marker> <name> <ok_blurb> <desc> [tail]
register_gate "tests/edge_precision_audit_selftest.py" "EDGE PRECISION AUDIT GATE: PASS" "edge precision audit (contract-family precision harness is correct + content-free)" "edge-precision-audit: a reusable content-free precision harness (tests/edge_precision_audit.py) that measures, per contract FAMILY (route/openapi/api_*/tauri/ci/job/sibling_stem/role_feature or any future candidate), how many file pairs a detector's shared-contract edges couple and how many of those coincide with a real correction incident -- the MEASURED precision boundary issue #721 requires before a detector may ship, and the wallpaper check (high emitted-pair volume with few incident hits) it forbids. This gate proves the harness LOGIC deterministically WITHOUT git/Postgres/network via --selftest: (1) family_of() parses the 'family::key' namespace and treats a bare file-path/table dst as NOT a synthetic contract; (2) pairs_from_groups() emits exactly C(n,2) undirected pairs per contract key and DAMPENS OUT a hot key touched by more than veripsa.hub_degree distinct files (mirrors core._claim_adjacency res_hubs, so a hub key never couples all its users = the anti-wallpaper rule); (3) pair emission is deterministic / order-independent; (4) content-free source posture -- the harness reads no repo file body (no read_text/read_bytes/io.open/codecs.open); it consumes only the extracted graph (contract KEY names + paths) and combined_recall incident pairs (paths + commit SUBJECT booleans). The incident-precision number is explicitly a LOWER BOUND (a real coupling that never surfaced in a revert/fix commit counts as a miss), documented as such so it is read together with emitted-pair volume + fan-out, never alone." "edge-precision-audit harness is correct and content-free: family-namespace parsing (bare path/table is not a contract), exact C(n,2) pair emission with hot-key (>hub_degree) dampening (the anti-wallpaper rule), deterministic order-independent emission, and a content-free source posture (graph keys/paths + incident pairs only, no file bodies). The incident-precision output is a documented LOWER BOUND read together with emitted-pair volume and fan-out." 20
